<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>KeeperFX-E • Community</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><script src="/app.js" defer></script></head><body><header><a href="/">KeeperFX-E</a><nav aria-label="Community"><a href="/">Overview</a><a href="/servers">Servers</a><a href="/events">Events</a><a href="/profile">My Keeper</a><a href="/device">Connect game</a></nav><p id="session">Guest · LAN and direct play need no account</p></header><main><p class="eyebrow">The dungeon is open</p><h1>Find your next rival.<br>Keep your own kingdom.</h1><p>Public games, community events and your match history. Accounts are optional. Games use KeeperFX’s synchronized simulation; dedicated hosts can run without a display.</p><p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section id="public-profile" hidden></section><section id="login-panel"><h2>Your Keeper account</h2><form id="login"><label>Player name<input name="name" required minlength="3" maxlength="24" autocomplete="username"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" required minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password"></label><button name="action" value="login">Sign in</button><button name="action" value="register">Create account</button></form><details><summary>Recover your account</summary><p>Use an offline recovery code. This revokes all signed-in sessions and existing codes.</p><form id="recover"><label>Player name<input name="name" required autocomplete="username"></label><label>Recovery code<input name="code" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>New password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" required autocomplete="new-password"></label><button>Reset password</button></form></details></section><section id="pair-panel"><h2>Connect the game</h2><p>Choose Sign In inside the game, then enter its pairing code here. Approve only a code displayed by your own game.</p><form id="pair"><label>Game pairing code<input name="code" required minlength="8" maxlength="8" autocomplete="off"></label><button>Approve this game</button></form></section><section id="server-panel"><div class="section-title"><h2>Server browser</h2><button id="refresh">Refresh</button></div><label>Filter servers<input id="filter" type="search" placeholder="Name, map or region"></label><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Server</th><th>Map</th><th>Players</th><th>Engine</th><th>Connection</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="servers"></tbody></table></div><p id="server-state">Loading directory…</p></section><section id="profile-panel" hidden><div class="section-title"><h2 id="profile-title">My Keeper</h2><button id="logout">Sign out</button></div><p id="profile-id"></p><label><input id="public" type="checkbox"> Make my profile and verified statistics public</label><div id="statistics"></div><h3>Account recovery</h3><p>Generate recovery codes and store them offline. New codes replace all previous codes.</p><form id="recovery-codes-form"><label>Current password<input name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><button id="recovery-codes">Generate recovery codes</button></form><pre id="recovery-output" hidden></pre><h3>Friends</h3><form id="friend"><label>Friend’s account ID<input name="user" required maxlength="32"></label><button>Send request</button></form><ul id="friends"></ul><h3>Match history</h3><p>Casual and player-confirmed results are separate from server-verified results. Disconnects do not count as verified wins.</p><div id="history"></div></section><section id="events-panel"><h2>Community calendar</h2><div id="events"></div><form id="event"><label>Event title<input name="title" required maxlength="80"></label><label>Format<select name="kind"><option value="match">Friendly match</option><option value="tournament">Tournament</option><option value="cooperative">Cooperative challenge</option></select></label><label>When<input name="starts" type="datetime-local" required></label><label>Description<textarea name="description" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><button>Schedule event</button></form></section><section><h2>Cooperative challenges</h2><div id="challenges"></div><h2>Replays</h2><p>Downloads require a matching engine version. Replay sharing is separate from live spectating.</p><div id="replays"></div><form id="upload-replay"><label>Completed match ID<input name="match" required maxlength="32"></label><label>Replay file (up to 2 MiB)<input name="replay" type="file" accept=".pck" required></label><button>Share replay</button></form></section></main><footer>KeeperFX-E community services · LAN and direct connections remain independent. · <a href="https://keeperfx-e.retrocs.org">Project website</a> · <a href="https://github.com/retrocs-org/KeeperFX-E">GitHub</a> · <a href="https://gitlab.kladhest.se/retrocs-org/keeperfx-e">GitLab</a></footer></body></html>
